---
description: >-
  Legacy "graph TD" flowchart syntax (not "flowchart TD") with an
  accTitle/accDescr pair, rendered under the "forest" theme via config; the
  in-body directive only sets logLevel, not theme — verifying legacy-syntax
  diagrams still pick up a config-supplied theme.
config:
  theme: forest
---
%%{init: { 'logLevel': 0} }%%
graph TD
  accTitle: This is a title
  accDescr: This is a description
  A[Christmas] -->|Get money| B(Go shopping)
  B --> C{Let me think}
  B --> G[/Another/]
  C ==>|One| D[Laptop]
  C -->|Two| E[iPhone]
  C -->|Three| F[fa:fa-car Car]
  subgraph section
    C
    D
    E
    F
    G
  end
